"If you're nothing without that suit, then you shouldn't have it"：如果你离开了这套战衣就一无是处的话，那你不应该拥有它
"With great power comes great responsibility"：能力越大，责任越大。
"This is my gift, my curse"：这是恩赐，也是诅咒。
"Slander is spoken. In print, it's libel"：谣言，嘴上的叫中伤，纸上的叫诽谤。
"No matter what I do, no matter how hard I try, the ones I love will always be the ones who pay"：无论我做什么，无论我多努力，我爱的人最终都会为我付出代价。
"Don't just follow the path. Make your own trail"：不要随波逐流，要找到自己的路。
"The world can not be changed without changing our thinking"：只有改变思维方式，世界才会改变。
"You can destroy my house, my equipment, but you can't break a fact, I am iron man"：你可以摧毁我的房子，我的装备，但是你摧毁不了一个事实，我是钢铁侠。
"I shouldn't be alive, unless it was for a reason"：我不该活着，除非另有原因。
"I know what I have to do, and I know what is right"：我知道我该做什么，也知道什么是对的。
"Failure is the fog through which we glimpse triumph"：失败是迷雾，穿过它，我们就可以瞥见光明。
"The early bird gets the worm, but it's the second mouse that gets the cheese"：早起的鸟儿有虫吃，但吃到奶酪的往往是第二只老鼠。
"We create our own demons"：恶由心生
"I can do this all day"：我可以跟你耗一整天。
"I don't want to kill anyone. I don't like bullies; I don't care where they're from"：我不杀生，不喜欢恶霸，也不在乎他们来自哪里。
"I'm loyal to nothing except the dream"：我只忠于我的梦想。
"But the price of freedom is high. It always has been. And it's a price I'm willing to pay"：但是自由的代价很高。一直都是如此。这是我愿意付出的代价。
"I can't control their fear, only my own"：我控制不了他人的恐惧，我只能控制自己的恐惧。
"Compromise where you can. Where you can't, don't"：该让步时让步，不该让步时决不退让。
"A strong man who has known power all his life, they lose respect for that power. But a weak man who values of strength & loves, compassion"：强者的力量是与生俱来的，而弱者，懂得力量的价值，有爱心、懂得怜悯。
"Whatever happens tomorrow you must promise me one thing. That you will stay who you are. Not a perfect soldier, but a good man"：无论明天发生什么，答应我一件事情：坚持做你自己，一个好人，而不是一个好兵。
"The sun will shine on us again"：太阳会再次照耀我们。

